flowchart LR
    room[Room microphone]
    wake[Wake word]
    assist[Home Assistant Assist]
    stt[Speech-to-text]
    intent{Deterministic home intent?}
    control[Home control]
    llm[Optional local/cloud LLM]
    tts[Text-to-speech]
    speaker[Room speaker]

    room --> wake --> assist --> stt --> intent
    intent -->|yes| control --> tts
    intent -->|no| llm --> tts --> speaker

